      "category": "Text",
      "text": "county, the city or village, as the case may be, who served in the army or the navy or marine corps of the United States in the war of the rebellion, or who served in the regular or volunteer army or the navy or the marine corps of the United States during the war with Spain or during the insurrection in the Philippine Islands, or who served in the army or navy or marine corps of the United States during the world war, or who has served in the regular army or navy or marine corps of the United States, and who was honorably discharged from such service. A refusal to give such leave of absence to one entitled thereto shall be neglect of duty.\"",
